			"Message": "chore(Cocoon): Purge stale Target build artifacts and update RouteManifest timestamp\n\nRemove all compiled `Target/` directory output (JS bundles, source maps, TypeScript build info) that accumulated from prior ESBuild runs. These artifacts are transient build output and should not be tracked in version control — they are regenerated during the build pipeline.\n\nUpdate the `Source/Generated/RouteManifest.ts` generation timestamp from `2026-05-19T01:54:32Z` to `2026-05-19T03:06:11Z` to reflect the current build cycle. The `RouteManifest.Report.md` is also refreshed with the new timestamp metadata.\n\nThis keeps the repository clean of stale compiled output while maintaining the manifest's synchronization with the build pipeline.",
